{"id":"vod_bf_14154","vodId":"14154","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"幻想万华镜","name_cn":"幻想万华镜","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第16集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/91dc109abb7ab4f6c03d0e5e5c25ea6d.jpg"},"summary":"《幻想万华镜》，全名《幻想万华镜 ~The Memories Of Phantasm~》，是同人社团满福神社创作的东方Project二次创作同人动画，于2011年开始推出，其音乐由幽闭星光负责制作。本动画并非东方的官方动画化，亦不是商业动画，现有《春雪异变之章》，《红雾异变之章（前篇）》，《红雾异变之章（中篇）》，《红雾异变之章（后篇）》，《花之异变之章（前篇）》，《花之异变章（后篇）》，《巨大妖怪之章》，《永夜异变之章（前篇）》和《永夜异变之章（中篇）》、《永夜异变之章（后篇）》，《试胆大会（前篇）》，《试胆大会（后篇）》十二话，除此之外的其他仅为PV。在《红雾异变之章（后篇）》结尾预告下一话将改编《东方星莲船》。但是，满福神社在5月24日发布的第五话预告片中，第五话为《东方花映冢》而不是原来的《东方星莲船》。然后在10月18日发布的《花之异变之章（后篇）》结尾预告下一话有可能将改编《东方风神录》。尽管如此，《春雪异变之章》在发布前即被东方Project爱好者赋与了很高的期望，其音乐亦受到不少好评。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"},{"name":"东方同人动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:49:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"classic":true,"franchise":"touhou","fanWork":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanxiangwanhuajing/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.c